# --- illustration review harness (packages/images/review/) ---
# The audit trail (worklists, verdicts, reports, scripts) IS tracked — it's what makes the
# 2,612-image rework reproducible. Only the bulky regenerable artifacts are ignored: the
# contact sheets alone are 3.7GB, and the webp/png dirs are staging on the way into
# factoid-webp/ + assets-png/, which are themselves tracked.
